A completion that runs past its end line with lines that already match the buffer is trimmed, so they are not shown as changes.
provider: scripted
row: 2
col: 4
viewportTop: 1
viewportBottom: 20
-- buffer.txt --
def main():
    pass
    foo
    bar
-- steps --
respond 2-2
  | "    x = 1"
  | "    foo"
  | "    bar"
request-completion manual
expect shown requests=1
  display:
    | modification 2 replace_chars
accept
expect hidden target=none
  buffer:
    | "def main():"
    | "    x = 1"
    | "    foo"
    | "    bar"
